OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReopened waste site will not cut
OL,4,Afly-tipping, council told
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a meeting of the Keighley and
OL,7,FIlkley Area Committee was told on
OL,8,FThursday that while the number of
OL,9,Ffly-tipping incidents in the area had
OL,10,Ffallen recently, the tonnage being
OL,11,Fdumped had increased.
OL,13,FCatherine Smith, street cleansing and
OL,14,Fparks service manager, said: "You get a
OL,15,Fsmaller amount of fly-tips, but those
OL,16,Fare on a larger scale."
